      6*Shadow7.wpP (start j) + 5*Shadow7.liveW (start j) + 11*Shadow7.lowsP (start j) + 616 + 3*Shadow7.wpP (start j + 15) := by
  obtain ⟨t1, t2, m1, m2, s1, s2⟩ := partsC_counts j h0 h1
